   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "The House adopted the amendment in the nature of a substitute as agreed to by the Committee of the Whole House on the state of the Union.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H35000",
   "actionDate": "1990-05-23",
   "actionTime": "21:29:22",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "The previous question was ordered pursuant to the rule.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H32600",
   "actionDate": "1990-05-23",
   "actionTime": "21:27:55",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "The House rose from the Committee of the Whole House on the state of the Union to report H.R. 3030.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "1990-05-23",
   "actionTime": "20:14:43",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "DEBATE - Pursuant to the provisions of H. Res. 399, the Committee of the Whole proceeded with one hour of debate on the Dingell compromise substitute amendment relating to that portion of the bill dealing with Clean Alternative Fuel Vehicles.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "1990-05-23",
   "actionTime": "18:45:19",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "DEBATE - Pursuant to the provisions of H. Res. 399, the Committee of the Whole proceeded with one hour of debate on the Dingell compromise substitute amendment relating to the establishment of air pollution control regulations from the offshore oil and gas platforms on the Outer Continental Shelf (OCS).",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "1990-05-23",
   "actionTime": "17:22:43",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "DEBATE - Pursuant to the provisions of H. Res. 399, the Committee of the Whole proceeded with one hour of debate on the Dingell compromise substitute amendment on Chlorofluorocarbons (CFCs).",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "1990-05-23",
   "actionTime": "17:13:37",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "DEBATE - Pursuant to the provisions of H. Res. 399, the Committee of the Whole proceeded with one hour of debate on the Dingell compromise substitute amendment to the provisions of the bill relating to \"Maximum Achievable Control Technology\" (MACT).",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "1990-05-23",
   "actionTime": "16:18:56",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "DEBATE - Pursuant to the provisions of H. Res. 399, the Committee of the Whole proceeded with thirty minutes of debate on the Sikorski amendment.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "1990-05-23",
   "actionTime": "14:43:43",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "DEBATE - Pursuant to the provisions of H. Res. 399, the Committee of the Whole proceeded with one hour of debate on the Wise amendment.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "1990-05-23",
   "actionTime": "13:10:21",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "DEBATE - Pursuant to the provisions of H. Res. 399, the Committee of the Whole proceeded with sixty minutes of debate on the Rostenkowski amendments en bloc.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "1990-05-23",
   "actionTime": "12:39:19",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "DEBATE - Pursuant to the provisions of H. Res. 399, the Committee of the Whole proceeded with thirty minutes of debate on the Roe amendment.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "1990-05-23",
   "actionTime": "12:06:01",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "DEBATE - Pursuant to the provisions of H. Res. 399, the Committee of the Whole is proceeding with thirty minutes of debate on the Dingell amendments en bloc.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H32050",
   "actionDate": "1990-05-23",
   "actionTime": "12:03:18",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "The House resolved into Committee of the Whole House on the state of the Union for further consideration.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "1990-05-23",
   "actionTime": "12:02:27",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 3030. Previous question shall be considered as ordered without intervening motions except motion to recommit with or without instructions. It shall be in order to consider the amendment in the nature of a substitute recommended by the Committee on Energy and Commerce now printed in the bill as an original bill for the purpose of amendment under the five-minute rule. All points of order against said substitute are waived. The Committee on Rules is authorized to file a supplemental report at any time on May 23, 1990 after the adoption of this resolution. Measure will be considered read. Specified amendments are in order. Only the amendments printed in the supplemental report of the Committee on Rules accompanying this resolution or as specified within this resolution are in order. After passage of H.R. 3030, it shall be in order to take from the  ...",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H30000",
   "actionDate": "1990-05-23",
   "actionTime": "12:02:22",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Considered under the provisions of rule H. Res. 399.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H1L220",
   "actionDate": "1990-05-23",
   "actionTime": "12:00:37",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Rule H. Res. 399 passed House.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H1L210",
   "actionDate": "1990-05-22",
   "actionTime": "23:58:01",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Rules Committee Resolution H. Res. 399 Reported to House. Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 3030. Previous question shall be considered as ordered without intervening motions except motion to recommit with or without instructions. It shall be in order to consider the amendment in the nature of a substitute recommended by the Committee on Energy and Commerce now printed in the bill as an original bill for the purpose of amendment under the five-minute rule. All points of order against said substitute are waived. The Committee on Rules is authorized to file a supplemental report at any time on May 23, 1990 after the adoption of this resolution. Measure will be considered read. Specified amendments are in order. Only the amendments printed in the supplemental report of the Committee on Rules accompanying this resolution or as specified within this resolution are in order. After passage of H.R. 3030, it shall be in order to take from the  ...",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H32700",
   "actionDate": "1990-05-21",
   "actionTime": "18:35:51",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Committee of the Whole House on the state of the Union rises leaving H.R. 3030 as unfinished business.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
