   },
   "text": "GENERAL DEBATE - Pursuant to the unanimous consent request agreed to May 17, 1990, the Committee of the Whole proceeded with eight hours of general debate divided as follows: Six hours to be equally divided and controlled by Messrs. Dingel and Lent; one hour to be equally divided and controlled by Messrs. Anderson and Shuster; one hour to be equally divided and controlled by Messrs. Rostenkowski and Frenzel.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
